      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. that makes sense. just to be 100% sure though, does it matter if the knowledge is something really specific that i just happened to memorize? like if there's a really unique architecture or a specific way they structure their logic that isn't \"standard\" industry practice? i don't want to accidentally violate the nda if i use something that feels too close to what they do.",
